<body lang=EN-US link=blue vlink=purple style='tab-interval:.5in;word-wrap:
break-word'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;color:navy'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;color:navy'>Richard Hind </span></b><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;color:navy'>webpage</span><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:
normal'><span style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"ZapfChancery",serif;
color:navy'><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"ZapfChancery",serif;color:navy'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Address: </span></b><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Department of
Mathematics, University of Notre Dame, Notre Dame, IN<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Email: </span></b><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'><a
href="mailto:hind.1@nd.edu">hind.1@nd.edu</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"ZapfChancery",serif;color:navy'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;
color:navy'><a href="cvhind_2026.pdf">Curriculum Vitae<span style='font-size:
12.0pt'><o:p></o:p></span></a></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='color:navy'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'><a
href="https://www3.nd.edu/~rhind/math10270/">Mathematics in Architecture</a>,
Math 10270, Spring 2019.</span><span class=MsoHyperlink><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;
color:navy'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;
color:navy'><a href="http://www.math.nd.edu/">Department of Mathematics, Notre
Dame</a><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;
color:navy'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:20.0pt;font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Publications and
Preprints<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Filling by holomorphic disks with
weakly <span class=SpellE>pseudoconvex</span> boundary conditions, </span></i><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Geom. <span class=SpellE>Funct</span>.
Anal., 7(1997), 462-495.<i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><o:p></o:p></i></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Holomorphic filling of RP^3, </span></i><span
class=SpellE><span style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Commun</span></span><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>. <span class=SpellE>Comtemp</span>.
Math., 3(2000), 349-363.<i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><o:p></o:p></i></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=SpellE><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Symplectic</span></i></span><i
style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='font-family:"Times",serif;
color:navy'> geometry and the uniqueness of <span class=SpellE>Grauert</span>
tubes</span></i><span style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>, (with D.
Burns), Geom. <span class=SpellE>Funct</span>. Anal., 11(2001), 1-10.<i
style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><o:p></o:p></i></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Antiholomorphic involutions on
Stein manifolds</span></i><span style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>,
Intern. J. of Math., 14(2003), 479-487.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>The geometry of <span
class=SpellE>Grauert</span> tubes and complexifications of symmetric spaces, </span></i><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>(with D. Burns and S. <span
class=SpellE>Halverscheid</span>), Duke Math. J., 118(2003), 465-491.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Stein fillings of Lens spaces, </span></i><span
class=SpellE><span style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Commun</span></span><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>. <span class=SpellE>Comtemp</span>.
Math., 5(2003), 967-982.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span class=SpellE><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-family:"Times",serif;color:navy'>Lagrangian</span></i></span><i
